| `refactor.journal_path` | string | `.evidence/refactor-journal.json` | required repo-relative path; ignored, untracked, usable, no symlink traversal; sibling lock also ignored and untracked | `scripts/apply_refactor.py` | Durable raw-byte and mode undo journal, protected by an exclusive nonblocking sibling `.lock`; startup recovers before reading the next spec, then applies it in the same invocation. Dry-run creates nothing and reports pending recovery. Corrupt evidence, conflicting bytes or a live recorded gate group refuse with journal_conflict. | choosing a proposal: `agents/practice_refactor` and `agents/doc_reviewer`; gate policy: `make_targets` | always |
